/h2><div></div><div><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.PeakDetect/isDetected/ aria-label=isDetected aria-describedby=isDetected-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>isDetected</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=isDetected-description>isDetected is set to true when a peak is detected.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5/createConvolver/ aria-label=createConvolver() aria-describedby=createConvolver()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>createConvolver()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=createConvolver()-description>Create a p5.Convolver</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5/freqToMidi/ aria-label=freqToMidi() aria-describedby=freqToMidi()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>freqToMidi()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=freqToMidi()-description>Returns the closest MIDI note value for a given frequency.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5/getAudioContext/ aria-label=getAudioContext() aria-describedby=getAudioContext()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>getAudioContext()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=getAudioContext()-description>Returns the Audio Context for this sketch</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5/getOutputVolume/ aria-label=getOutputVolume() aria-describedby=getOutputVolume()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>getOutputVolume()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=getOutputVolume()-description>Returns a number representing the output volume for sound in this sketch.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5/loadSound/ aria-label=loadSound() aria-describedby=loadSound()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>loadSound()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=loadSound()-description>loadSound() returns a new p5.SoundFile from a specified path</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5/midiToFreq/ aria-label=midiToFreq() aria-describedby=midiToFreq()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>midiToFreq()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=midiToFreq()-description>Returns the frequency value of a MIDI note value</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5/outputVolume/ aria-label=outputVolume() aria-describedby=outputVolume()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>outputVolume()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=outputVolume()-description>Scale the output of all sound in this sketch</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5/sampleRate/ aria-label=sampleRate() aria-describedby=sampleRate()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>sampleRate()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=sampleRate()-description>Returns a number representing the sample rate, in samples per second, of all sound objects in this audio context</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5/saveSound/ aria-label=saveSound() aria-describedby=saveSound()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>saveSound()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=saveSound()-description>Save a p5.SoundFile as a .wav file</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5/setBPM/ aria-label=setBPM() aria-describedby=setBPM()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>setBPM()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=setBPM()-description>Set the global tempo, in beats per minute, for all p5.Parts</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5/soundFormats/ aria-label=soundFormats() aria-describedby=soundFormats()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>soundFormats()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=soundFormats()-description>List the SoundFile formats that you will include</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5/soundOut/ aria-label=soundOut aria-describedby=soundOut-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>soundOut</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=soundOut-description>p5.soundOut is the p5.sound final output bus</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5/userStartAudio/ aria-label=userStartAudio() aria-describedby=userStartAudio()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>userStartAudio()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=userStartAudio()-description>It is not only a good practice to give users control over starting audio</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.Amplitude/ id=p5.Amplitude><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.Amplitude</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Amplitude/getLevel/ aria-label=getLevel() aria-describedby=getLevel()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>getLevel()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=getLevel()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Amplitude/setInput/ aria-label=setInput() aria-describedby=setInput()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>setInput()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=setInput()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Amplitude/smooth/ aria-label=smooth() aria-describedby=smooth()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>smooth()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=smooth()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Amplitude/toggleNormalize/ aria-label=toggleNormalize() aria-describedby=toggleNormalize()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>toggleNormalize()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=toggleNormalize()-description>Determines whether the results of Amplitude.process() will be Normalized</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.AudioIn/ id=p5.AudioIn><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.AudioIn</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.AudioIn/amp/ aria-label=amp() aria-describedby=amp()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>amp()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=amp()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.AudioIn/amplitude/ aria-label=amplitude aria-describedby=amplitude-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>amplitude</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=amplitude-description>Input amplitude, connect to it by default but not to master out</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.AudioIn/connect/ aria-label=connect() aria-describedby=connect()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>connect()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=connect()-description>Connect to an audio unit</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.AudioIn/currentSource/ aria-label=currentSource aria-describedby=currentSource-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>currentSource</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=currentSource-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.AudioIn/disconnect/ aria-label=disconnect() aria-describedby=disconnect()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>disconnect()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=disconnect()-description>Disconnect the AudioIn from all audio units</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.AudioIn/enabled/ aria-label=enabled aria-describedby=enabled-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>enabled</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=enabled-description>Client must allow browser to access their microphone / audioin source</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.AudioIn/getLevel/ aria-label=getLevel() aria-describedby=getLevel()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>getLevel()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=getLevel()-description>Read the Amplitude (volume level) of an AudioIn</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.AudioIn/getSources/ aria-label=getSources() aria-describedby=getSources()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>getSources()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=getSources()-description>Returns a list of available input sources</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.AudioIn/input/ aria-label=input aria-describedby=input-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>input</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=input-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.AudioIn/mediaStream/ aria-label=mediaStream aria-describedby=mediaStream-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>mediaStream</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=mediaStream-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.AudioIn/output/ aria-label=output aria-describedby=output-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>output</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=output-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.AudioIn/setSource/ aria-label=setSource() aria-describedby=setSource()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>setSource()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=setSource()-description>Set the input source</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.AudioIn/start/ aria-label=start() aria-describedby=start()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>start()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=start()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.AudioIn/stop/ aria-label=stop() aria-describedby=stop()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>stop()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=stop()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.AudioIn/stream/ aria-label=stream aria-describedby=stream-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>stream</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=stream-description></p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.AudioVoice/ id=p5.AudioVoice><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.AudioVoice</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.AudioVoice/connect/ aria-label=connect() aria-describedby=connect()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>connect()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=connect()-description>Connect to p5 objects or Web Audio Nodes</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.AudioVoice/disconnect/ aria-label=disconnect() aria-describedby=disconnect()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>disconnect()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=disconnect()-description>Disconnect from soundOut</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.BandPass/ id=p5.BandPass><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.BandPass</h3></a></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.Biquad/ id=p5.Biquad><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.Biquad</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Biquad/freq/ aria-label=freq() aria-describedby=freq()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>freq()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=freq()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Biquad/gain/ aria-label=gain() aria-describedby=gain()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>gain()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=gain()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Biquad/res/ aria-label=res() aria-describedby=res()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>res()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=res()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Biquad/setType/ aria-label=setType() aria-describedby=setType()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>setType()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=setType()-description></p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.Compressor/ id=p5.Compressor><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.Compressor</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Compressor/attack/ aria-label=attack() aria-describedby=attack()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>attack()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=attack()-description>Get current attack or set value w/ time ramp</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Compressor/compressor/ aria-label=compressor aria-describedby=compressor-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>compressor</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=compressor-description>The p5.Compressor is built with a Web Audio Dynamics Compressor Node</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Compressor/knee/ aria-label=knee() aria-describedby=knee()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>knee()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=knee()-description>Get current knee or set value w/ time ramp</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Compressor/process/ aria-label=process() aria-describedby=process()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>process()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=process()-description>Performs the same function as .connect, but also accepts optional parameters to set compressor's audioParams</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Compressor/ratio/ aria-label=ratio() aria-describedby=ratio()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>ratio()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=ratio()-description>Get current ratio or set value w/ time ramp</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Compressor/reduction/ aria-label=reduction() aria-describedby=reduction()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>reduction()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=reduction()-description>Return the current reduction value</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Compressor/release/ aria-label=release() aria-describedby=release()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>release()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=release()-description>Get current release or set value w/ time ramp</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Compressor/set/ aria-label=set() aria-describedby=set()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>set()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=set()-description>Set the paramters of a compressor.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Compressor/threshold/ aria-label=threshold() aria-describedby=threshold()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>threshold()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=threshold()-description>Get current threshold or set value w/ time ramp</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.Convolver/ id=p5.Convolver><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.Convolver</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Convolver/addImpulse/ aria-label=addImpulse() aria-describedby=addImpulse()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>addImpulse()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=addImpulse()-description>Load and assign a new Impulse Response to the p5.Convolver</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Convolver/convolverNode/ aria-label=convolverNode aria-describedby=convolverNode-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>convolverNode</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=convolverNode-description>Internally, the p5.Convolver uses the a Web Audio Convolver Node.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Convolver/impulses/ aria-label=impulses aria-describedby=impulses-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>impulses</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=impulses-description>If you load multiple impulse files using the .addImpulse method, they will be stored as Objects in this Array</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Convolver/process/ aria-label=process() aria-describedby=process()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>process()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=process()-description>Connect a source to the convolver.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Convolver/resetImpulse/ aria-label=resetImpulse() aria-describedby=resetImpulse()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>resetImpulse()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=resetImpulse()-description>Similar to .addImpulse, except that the .impulses Array is reset to save memory</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Convolver/toggleImpulse/ aria-label=toggleImpulse() aria-describedby=toggleImpulse()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>toggleImpulse()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=toggleImpulse()-description>If you have used .addImpulse() to add multiple impulses to a p5.Convolver, then you can use this method to toggle between the items in the .impulses Array</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.Delay/ id=p5.Delay><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.Delay</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Delay/amp/ aria-label=amp() aria-describedby=amp()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>amp()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=amp()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Delay/connect/ aria-label=connect() aria-describedby=connect()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>connect()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=connect()-description>Send output to a p5.sound or web audio object</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Delay/delayTime/ aria-label=delayTime() aria-describedby=delayTime()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>delayTime()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=delayTime()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Delay/disconnect/ aria-label=disconnect() aria-describedby=disconnect()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>disconnect()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=disconnect()-description>Disconnect all output.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Delay/feedback/ aria-label=feedback() aria-describedby=feedback()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>feedback()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=feedback()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Delay/filter/ aria-label=filter() aria-describedby=filter()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>filter()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=filter()-description>Set a lowpass filter frequency for the delay</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Delay/leftDelay/ aria-label=leftDelay aria-describedby=leftDelay-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>leftDelay</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=leftDelay-description>The p5.Delay is built with two Web Audio Delay Nodes, one for each stereo channel.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Delay/process/ aria-label=process() aria-describedby=process()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>process()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=process()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Delay/rightDelay/ aria-label=rightDelay aria-describedby=rightDelay-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>rightDelay</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=rightDelay-description>The p5.Delay is built with two Web Audio Delay Nodes, one for each stereo channel.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Delay/setType/ aria-label=setType() aria-describedby=setType()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>setType()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=setType()-description>Choose a preset type of delay</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.Distortion/ id=p5.Distortion><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.Distortion</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Distortion/WaveShaperNode/ aria-label=WaveShaperNode aria-describedby=WaveShaperNode-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>WaveShaperNode</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=WaveShaperNode-description>The p5.Distortion is built with a Web Audio WaveShaper Node.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Distortion/getAmount/ aria-label=getAmount() aria-describedby=getAmount()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>getAmount()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=getAmount()-description>Return the distortion amount, typically between 0-1.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Distortion/getOversample/ aria-label=getOversample() aria-describedby=getOversample()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>getOversample()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=getOversample()-description>Return the oversampling.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Distortion/process/ aria-label=process() aria-describedby=process()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>process()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=process()-description>Process a sound source, optionally specify amount and oversample values.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Distortion/set/ aria-label=set() aria-describedby=set()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>set()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=set()-description>Set the amount and oversample of the waveshaper distortion.</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.EQ/ id=p5.EQ><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.EQ</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.EQ/bands/ aria-label=bands aria-describedby=bands-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>bands</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=bands-description>The p5.EQ is built with abstracted p5.Filter objects</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.EQ/process/ aria-label=process() aria-describedby=process()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>process()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=process()-description>Process an input by connecting it to the EQ</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.Effect/ id=p5.Effect><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.Effect</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Effect/amp/ aria-label=amp() aria-describedby=amp()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>amp()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=amp()-description>Set the output volume of the filter.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Effect/chain/ aria-label=chain() aria-describedby=chain()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>chain()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=chain()-description>Link effects together in a chain Example usage: filter.chain(reverb, delay, panner); May be used with an open-ended number of arguments</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Effect/connect/ aria-label=connect() aria-describedby=connect()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>connect()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=connect()-description>Send output to a p5.js-sound, Web Audio Node, or use signal to control an AudioParam</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Effect/disconnect/ aria-label=disconnect() aria-describedby=disconnect()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>disconnect()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=disconnect()-description>Disconnect all output.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Effect/drywet/ aria-label=drywet() aria-describedby=drywet()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>drywet()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=drywet()-description>Adjust the dry/wet value.</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.Envelope/ id=p5.Envelope><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.Envelope</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/add/ aria-label=add() aria-describedby=add()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>add()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=add()-description>Add a value to the p5.Oscillator's output amplitude, and return the oscillator</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/attackLevel/ aria-label=attackLevel aria-describedby=attackLevel-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>attackLevel</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=attackLevel-description>Level once attack is complete.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/attackTime/ aria-label=attackTime() aria-describedby=attackTime()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>attackTime()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=attackTime()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/decayLevel/ aria-label=decayLevel aria-describedby=decayLevel-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>decayLevel</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=decayLevel-description>Level after decay</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/decayTime/ aria-label=decayTime aria-describedby=decayTime-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>decayTime</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=decayTime-description>Time until envelope reaches decayLevel.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/mult/ aria-label=mult() aria-describedby=mult()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>mult()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=mult()-description>Multiply the p5.Envelope's output amplitude by a fixed value</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/play/ aria-label=play() aria-describedby=play()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>play()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=play()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/ramp/ aria-label=ramp() aria-describedby=ramp()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>ramp()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=ramp()-description>Exponentially ramp to a value using the first two values from setADSR(attackTime, decayTime) as time constants for simple exponential ramps</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/releaseLevel/ aria-label=releaseLevel aria-describedby=releaseLevel-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>releaseLevel</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=releaseLevel-description>Level at the end of the release.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/releaseTime/ aria-label=releaseTime() aria-describedby=releaseTime()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>releaseTime()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=releaseTime()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/scale/ aria-label=scale() aria-describedby=scale()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>scale()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=scale()-description>Scale this envelope's amplitude values to a given range, and return the envelope</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/set/ aria-label=set() aria-describedby=set()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>set()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=set()-description>Reset the envelope with a series of time/value pairs.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/setADSR/ aria-label=setADSR() aria-describedby=setADSR()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>setADSR()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=setADSR()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/setExp/ aria-label=setExp() aria-describedby=setExp()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>setExp()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=setExp()-description>Set whether the envelope ramp is linear (default) or exponential</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/setInput/ aria-label=setInput() aria-describedby=setInput()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>setInput()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=setInput()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/setRange/ aria-label=setRange() aria-describedby=setRange()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>setRange()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=setRange()-description>Set max (attackLevel) and min (releaseLevel) of envelope.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/triggerAttack/ aria-label=triggerAttack() aria-describedby=triggerAttack()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>triggerAttack()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=triggerAttack()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Envelope/triggerRelease/ aria-label=triggerRelease() aria-describedby=triggerRelease()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>triggerRelease()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=triggerRelease()-description></p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.FFT/ id=p5.FFT><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.FFT</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.FFT/analyze/ aria-label=analyze() aria-describedby=analyze()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>analyze()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=analyze()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.FFT/getCentroid/ aria-label=getCentroid() aria-describedby=getCentroid()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>getCentroid()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=getCentroid()-description>Returns the spectral centroid of the input signal</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.FFT/getEnergy/ aria-label=getEnergy() aria-describedby=getEnergy()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>getEnergy()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=getEnergy()-description>Returns the amount of energy (volume) at a specific frequency, or the average amount of energy between two frequencies</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.FFT/getOctaveBands/ aria-label=getOctaveBands() aria-describedby=getOctaveBands()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>getOctaveBands()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=getOctaveBands()-description>Calculates and Returns the 1/N Octave Bands N defaults to 3 and minimum central frequency to 15.625Hz</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.FFT/linAverages/ aria-label=linAverages() aria-describedby=linAverages()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>linAverages()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=linAverages()-description>Returns an array of average amplitude values for a given number of frequency bands split equally</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.FFT/logAverages/ aria-label=logAverages() aria-describedby=logAverages()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>logAverages()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=logAverages()-description>Returns an array of average amplitude values of the spectrum, for a given set of Octave Bands &lt;em>NOTE: analyze() must be called prior to logAverages()</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.FFT/setInput/ aria-label=setInput() aria-describedby=setInput()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>setInput()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=setInput()-description>Set the input source for the FFT analysis</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.FFT/smooth/ aria-label=smooth() aria-describedby=smooth()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>smooth()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=smooth()-description>Smooth FFT analysis by averaging with the last analysis frame.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.FFT/waveform/ aria-label=waveform() aria-describedby=waveform()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>waveform()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=waveform()-description></p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.Filter/ id=p5.Filter><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.Filter</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Filter/biquadFilter/ aria-label=biquadFilter aria-describedby=biquadFilter-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>biquadFilter</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=biquadFilter-description>The p5.Filter is built with a Web Audio BiquadFilter Node.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Filter/freq/ aria-label=freq() aria-describedby=freq()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>freq()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=freq()-description>Set the filter frequency, in Hz, from 10 to 22050 (the range of human hearing, although in reality most people hear in a narrower range).</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Filter/gain/ aria-label=gain() aria-describedby=gain()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>gain()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=gain()-description>Controls the gain attribute of a Biquad Filter</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Filter/process/ aria-label=process() aria-describedby=process()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>process()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=process()-description>Filter an audio signal according to a set of filter parameters.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Filter/res/ aria-label=res() aria-describedby=res()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>res()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=res()-description>Controls either width of a bandpass frequency, or the resonance of a low/highpass cutoff frequency.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Filter/set/ aria-label=set() aria-describedby=set()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>set()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=set()-description>Set the frequency and the resonance of the filter.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Filter/setType/ aria-label=setType() aria-describedby=setType()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>setType()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=setType()-description>Set the type of a p5.Filter</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Filter/toggle/ aria-label=toggle() aria-describedby=toggle()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>toggle()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=toggle()-description>Toggle function</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.Gain/ id=p5.Gain><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.Gain</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Gain/amp/ aria-label=amp() aria-describedby=amp()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>amp()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=amp()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Gain/connect/ aria-label=connect() aria-describedby=connect()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>connect()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=connect()-description>Send output to a p5.sound or web audio object</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Gain/disconnect/ aria-label=disconnect() aria-describedby=disconnect()-description