" id=setBPM()-description>Set the tempo of this part, in Beats Per Minute.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Part/start/ aria-label=start() aria-describedby=start()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>start()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=start()-description>Start playback of this part</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Part/stop/ aria-label=stop() aria-describedby=stop()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>stop()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=stop()-description>Stop the part and cue it to step 0</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.PeakDetect/ id=p5.PeakDetect><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.PeakDetect</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.PeakDetect/onPeak/ aria-label=onPeak() aria-describedby=onPeak()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>onPeak()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=onPeak()-description>onPeak accepts two arguments: a function to call when a peak is detected</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.PeakDetect/update/ aria-label=update() aria-describedby=update()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>update()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=update()-description>The update method is run in the draw loop.</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.Phrase/ id=p5.Phrase><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.Phrase</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Phrase/sequence/ aria-label=sequence aria-describedby=sequence-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>sequence</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=sequence-description>Array of values to pass into the callback at each step of the phrase</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.PitchShifter/ id=p5.PitchShifter><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.PitchShifter</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.PitchShifter/shift/ aria-label=shift() aria-describedby=shift()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>shift()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=shift()-description></p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.PolySynth/ id=p5.PolySynth><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.PolySynth</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.PolySynth/AudioVoice/ aria-label=AudioVoice aria-describedby=AudioVoice-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>AudioVoice</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=AudioVoice-description>Monosynth that generates the sound for each note that is triggered</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.PolySynth/connect/ aria-label=connect() aria-describedby=connect()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>connect()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=connect()-description>Connect to a p5.sound / Web Audio object.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.PolySynth/disconnect/ aria-label=disconnect() aria-describedby=disconnect()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>disconnect()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=disconnect()-description>Disconnect all outputs</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.PolySynth/dispose/ aria-label=dispose() aria-describedby=dispose()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>dispose()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=dispose()-description>Get rid of the MonoSynth and free up its resources / memory.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.PolySynth/noteADSR/ aria-label=noteADSR() aria-describedby=noteADSR()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>noteADSR()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=noteADSR()-description>noteADSR sets the envelope for a specific note that has just been triggered</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.PolySynth/noteAttack/ aria-label=noteAttack() aria-describedby=noteAttack()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>noteAttack()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=noteAttack()-description>Trigger the Attack, and Decay portion of a MonoSynth</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.PolySynth/noteRelease/ aria-label=noteRelease() aria-describedby=noteRelease()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>noteRelease()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=noteRelease()-description>Trigger the Release of an AudioVoice note</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.PolySynth/notes/ aria-label=notes aria-describedby=notes-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>notes</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=notes-description>An object that holds information about which notes have been played and which notes are currently being played</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.PolySynth/play/ aria-label=play() aria-describedby=play()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>play()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=play()-description>Play a note by triggering noteAttack and noteRelease with sustain time</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.PolySynth/polyvalue/ aria-label=polyvalue aria-describedby=polyvalue-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>polyvalue</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=polyvalue-description>A PolySynth must have at least 1 voice, defaults to 8</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.PolySynth/setADSR/ aria-label=setADSR() aria-describedby=setADSR()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>setADSR()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=setADSR()-description>Set the PolySynths global envelope</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.Pulse/ id=p5.Pulse><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.Pulse</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Pulse/width/ aria-label=width() aria-describedby=width()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>width()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=width()-description>Set the width of a Pulse object (an oscillator that implements Pulse Width Modulation).</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.Reverb/ id=p5.Reverb><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.Reverb</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Reverb/amp/ aria-label=amp() aria-describedby=amp()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>amp()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=amp()-description>Set the output level of the reverb effect.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Reverb/connect/ aria-label=connect() aria-describedby=connect()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>connect()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=connect()-description>Send output to a p5.sound or web audio object</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Reverb/disconnect/ aria-label=disconnect() aria-describedby=disconnect()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>disconnect()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=disconnect()-description>Disconnect all output.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Reverb/drywet/ aria-label=drywet() aria-describedby=drywet()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>drywet()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=drywet()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Reverb/process/ aria-label=process() aria-describedby=process()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>process()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=process()-description>Connect a source to the reverb, and assign reverb parameters.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.Reverb/set/ aria-label=set() aria-describedby=set()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>set()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=set()-description></p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.SawOsc/ id=p5.SawOsc><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.SawOsc</h3></a></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.Score/ id=p5.Score><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.Score</h3></a>