-sm" id=stop()-description>Stop playback of the score.</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.SinOsc/ id=p5.SinOsc><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.SinOsc</h3></a></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.SoundFile/ id=p5.SoundFile><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.SoundFile</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/addCue/ aria-label=addCue() aria-describedby=addCue()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>addCue()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=addCue()-description>Schedule events to trigger every time a MediaElement (audio/video) reaches a playback cue point.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/amp/ aria-label=amp() aria-describedby=amp()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>amp()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=amp()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/channels/ aria-label=channels() aria-describedby=channels()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>channels()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=channels()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/clearCues/ aria-label=clearCues() aria-describedby=clearCues()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>clearCues()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=clearCues()-description>Remove all of the callbacks that had originally been scheduled via the addCue method.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/connect/ aria-label=connect() aria-describedby=connect()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>connect()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=connect()-description>Connects the output of a p5sound object to input of another p5.sound object</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/currentTime/ aria-label=currentTime() aria-describedby=currentTime()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>currentTime()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=currentTime()-description>Return the current position of the p5.SoundFile playhead, in seconds</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/disconnect/ aria-label=disconnect() aria-describedby=disconnect()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>disconnect()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=disconnect()-description>Disconnects the output of this p5sound object.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/duration/ aria-label=duration() aria-describedby=duration()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>duration()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=duration()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/frames/ aria-label=frames() aria-describedby=frames()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>frames()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=frames()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/getBlob/ aria-label=getBlob() aria-describedby=getBlob()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>getBlob()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=getBlob()-description>This method is useful for sending a SoundFile to a server</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/getPan/ aria-label=getPan() aria-describedby=getPan()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>getPan()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=getPan()-description>Returns the current stereo pan position (-1.0 to 1.0)</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/getPeaks/ aria-label=getPeaks() aria-describedby=getPeaks()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>getPeaks()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=getPeaks()-description>Returns an array of amplitude peaks in a p5.SoundFile that can be used to draw a static waveform</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/isLoaded/ aria-label=isLoaded() aria-describedby=isLoaded()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>isLoaded()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=isLoaded()-description>Returns true if the sound file finished loading successfully.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/isLooping/ aria-label=isLooping() aria-describedby=isLooping()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>isLooping()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=isLooping()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/isPaused/ aria-label=isPaused() aria-describedby=isPaused()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>isPaused()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=isPaused()-description>Returns true if a p5.SoundFile is paused, false if not (i.e</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/isPlaying/ aria-label=isPlaying() aria-describedby=isPlaying()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>isPlaying()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=isPlaying()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/jump/ aria-label=jump() aria-describedby=jump()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>jump()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=jump()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/loop/ aria-label=loop() aria-describedby=loop()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>loop()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=loop()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/onended/ aria-label=onended() aria-describedby=onended()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>onended()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=onended()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/pan/ aria-label=pan() aria-describedby=pan()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>pan()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=pan()-description>Set the stereo panning of a p5.sound object to a floating point number between -1.0 (left) and 1.0 (right)</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/pause/ aria-label=pause() aria-describedby=pause()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>pause()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=pause()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/play/ aria-label=play() aria-describedby=play()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>play()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=play()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/playMode/ aria-label=playMode() aria-describedby=playMode()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>playMode()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=playMode()-description>p5.SoundFile has two play modes: restart and sustain</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/rate/ aria-label=rate() aria-describedby=rate()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>rate()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=rate()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/removeCue/ aria-label=removeCue() aria-describedby=removeCue()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>removeCue()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=removeCue()-description>Remove a callback based on its ID</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/reverseBuffer/ aria-label=reverseBuffer() aria-describedby=reverseBuffer()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>reverseBuffer()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=reverseBuffer()-description>Reverses the p5.SoundFile's buffer source</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/sampleRate/ aria-label=sampleRate() aria-describedby=sampleRate()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>sampleRate()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=sampleRate()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/save/ aria-label=save() aria-describedby=save()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>save()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=save()-description>Save a p5.SoundFile as a .wav file</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/setBuffer/ aria-label=setBuffer() aria-describedby=setBuffer()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>setBuffer()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=setBuffer()-description>Replace the current Audio Buffer with a new Buffer.</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/setLoop/ aria-label=setLoop() aria-describedby=setLoop()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>setLoop()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=setLoop()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/setPath/ aria-label=setPath() aria-describedby=setPath()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>setPath()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=setPath()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/setVolume/ aria-label=setVolume() aria-describedby=setVolume()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>setVolume()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=setVolume()-description>Multiply the output volume (amplitude) of a sound file between 0.0 (silence) and 1.0 (full volume)</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/start/ aria-label=start() aria-describedby=start()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>start()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=start()-description></p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundFile/stop/ aria-label=stop() aria-describedby=stop()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>stop()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=stop()-description></p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.SoundLoop/ id=p5.SoundLoop><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.SoundLoop</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundLoop/bpm/ aria-label=bpm aria-describedby=bpm-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>bpm</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=bpm-description>Getters and Setters, setting any paramter will result in a change in the clock's frequency, that will be reflected after the next callback beats per minute (defaults to 60)</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundLoop/interval/ aria-label=interval aria-describedby=interval-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>interval</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=interval-description>length of the loops interval</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundLoop/iterations/ aria-label=iterations aria-describedby=iterations-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>iterations</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=iterations-description>how many times the callback has been called so far</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundLoop/maxIterations/ aria-label=maxIterations aria-describedby=maxIterations-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>maxIterations</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=maxIterations-description>Set a limit to the number of loops to play</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundLoop/musicalTimeMode/ aria-label=musicalTimeMode aria-describedby=musicalTimeMode-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>musicalTimeMode</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=musicalTimeMode-description>musicalTimeMode uses Tone.Time convention true if string, false if number</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundLoop/pause/ aria-label=pause() aria-describedby=pause()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>pause()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=pause()-description>Pause the loop</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundLoop/start/ aria-label=start() aria-describedby=start()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>start()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=start()-description>Start the loop</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundLoop/stop/ aria-label=stop() aria-describedby=stop()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>stop()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=stop()-description>Stop the loop</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundLoop/syncedStart/ aria-label=syncedStart() aria-describedby=syncedStart()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>syncedStart()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=syncedStart()-description>Synchronize loops</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundLoop/timeSignature/ aria-label=timeSignature aria-describedby=timeSignature-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>timeSignature</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=timeSignature-description>number of quarter notes in a measure (defaults to 4)</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.SoundRecorder/ id=p5.SoundRecorder><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.SoundRecorder</h3></a><div class=content-grid><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundRecorder/record/ aria-label=record() aria-describedby=record()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>record()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=record()-description>Start recording</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundRecorder/setInput/ aria-label=setInput() aria-describedby=setInput()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>setInput()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=setInput()-description>Connect a specific device to the p5.SoundRecorder</p></a></div><div class="col-span-3 overflow-hidden w-full"><a class="group hover:no-underline" href=/reference/p5.SoundRecorder/stop/ aria-label=stop() aria-describedby=stop()-description><span class="group-hover:underline text-body-mono"><span>stop()</span></span><p class="mt-1 text-sm" id=stop()-description>Stop the recording</p></a></div></div></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.SqrOsc/ id=p5.SqrOsc><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.SqrOsc</h3></a></div><div><a href=/reference/p5.sound/p5.TriOsc/ id=p5.TriOsc><h3 class="m-0 py-gutter-md">p5.TriOsc</h3></a></div></section></div></div></astro-island></div></main><footer class="bg-accent-color border-black border-t content-start gap-x-gutter-sm grid grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 md:gap-x-gutter-md pb-5 pt-md p